  "title": "M-PESA mobile money launched in Kenya",
  "summary": "M-PESA, a mobile-phone money transfer and payment service developed by Vodafone, was officially launched in Kenya by Safaricom on 6 March 2007. Safaricom reports 19,671 active users a month later and 1,041,522 by November 2007. A 2010 World Bank paper counts 9 million customers, about 40% of Kenyan adults.",
